## D5-clean-rebuild — final report

**Verdict: RELEASE GATE PASS** (all 11 gate steps exit 0; no forbidden dependency found).

### What was collected
All **11/11 D1–D4 tasks** → **53 promoted Lean files** copied into a fresh package `release/` plus the 5 pre-existing base skeleton files it depends on (`Stage1/*`, `Stage6/*`, `Basic`). Provenance checks: **0 cross-worktree hash conflicts**, **every result-card `sha256` matched**, and **58/58 origin files re-hashed unchanged** — no source artifact was modified.

### Clean-room build & pins (fresh directory `release/`, `.lake/build` wiped first)
| step | command | exit |
|---|---|---|
| fresh build | `lake build` | **0** (8944 jobs, 60 modules) |
| release root | `lake env lean ReleaseCheck.lean` | **0** |
| kernel audit | `lake env lean ReleaseAudit.lean` | **0** |
| per-module | `lake env lean <each of 58 modules>` | **0** (58/58) |
| source scan | `tools/scan_forbidden.py release` | **0** (61 files, 0 hard matches) |
| claim probe | `lake env lean ReleaseClaims.lean` (193 card-claimed names) | **0** |
| mathlib integrity | `git rev-parse/status` before & after | **0** (clean) |

Pins: `leanprover/lean4:v4.34.0-rc2` (commit `6a10ac8c22be`), lake `5.0.0-src+6a10ac8`, mathlib `7974e751bece493b6ff508039423ca9fa2452fa8` (`master-2026-09-04-26-g7974e751be`); full transitive package revs in `manifest/build-manifest.json`.

### Forbidden-dependency gate
